        <span class="tool-name">MacBook Pro 14″ (M1 Pro)</span>
        <p>The 2021 model — M1 Pro, 16GB, 512GB. Reliable workhorse that's never once complained. Only thing I miss is more RAM. Always more RAM.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-item">
      <div class="tool-icon"><Monitor size={22} /></div>
      <div class="tool-info">
        <span class="tool-name">Apple Thunderbolt Display</span>
        <p>27-inch 1440p. The only reason it's on my desk is that my office gave it to me for free. Sold.</p>
